{
  "name": "shop.buyers/v1",
  "description": "Business buyers: a signed-in buyer's group, prices, minimums and payment terms for the shop to apply through its own pricing, and quotes — asked for from the basket, priced by the owner, opened by the buyer (BUYERS.md).",
